   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi again,<br><br><div>\n\n        <p>Is it possible to remove a mainPanel from Shiny / R Studio? I\n mean, if I want a big sidePanel (without any mainPanel area), how \nshould I do it? I have tried simply to write:</p>\n\n<pre><code>   mainPanel()<br> </code></pre>\n\n<p>but it doens&#39;t work (it just empties the area...).</p>\n\n<p>Any suggestions?</p>\n\n    </div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "q3wH78O6y1kJ",
   "from": "Patrick Toche",
   "author": "e718c48d06f126f8",
   "date": "2014-02-08T17:49:13Z",
   "subject": "Re: Remove mainPanel area on Shiny / R Studio",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>try something like this:</div><div><br></div><div># ui.R</div><div><br></div><div>library(&quot;shiny&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>shinyUI(</div><div>  basicPage(</div><div>    textOutput(&quot;whatever&quot;)</div><div>  )</div><div>)</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
